cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "ShoggoTEh"
abstract: >
  ShoggoTEh is a deep learning pipeline for identifying and classifying
  transposable elements (TEs) in plant genomes. It uses Hyena-DNA to generate
  sequence embeddings from genomic windows and trains a one-hidden-layer MLP
  classifier to distinguish TE classes, genic, and intergenic regions without
  relying on alignment-based repeat detection. Named after the Shoggoths
  (H.P. Lovecraft) + TEh (transposable elements).
